{"_id":"WmStrBoostTier01","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/strength.png","name":"Ironbound Belt","sort":10000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"str"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0.1},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>A compact iron buckle lends surprising weight to this well-oiled leather belt.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +1:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Strength modifier by 1. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":1},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"wornbelt"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"str","value":1}}}}
{"_id":"WmStrBoostTier02","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/strength.png","name":"Stonebreaker Belt","sort":20000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"str"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0.1},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Stone-grain plates reinforce this belt, growing warm when its wearer exerts great force.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +2:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Strength modifier by 2. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":5},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"wornbelt"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"str","value":2}}}}
{"_id":"WmStrBoostTier03","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/strength.png","name":"Giantwrought Belt","sort":30000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"str"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0.1},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Oversized links and runic stitching make this belt feel as though it was fashioned for a giant.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +3:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Strength modifier by 3. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":9},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"wornbelt"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"str","value":3}}}}
{"_id":"WmStrBoostTier04","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/strength.png","name":"Titan's Girdle","sort":40000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"str"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0.1},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>This broad girdle carries mountain-shaped engravings that pulse like a slow heartbeat.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +4:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Strength modifier by 4. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":13},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"wornbelt"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"str","value":4}}}}
{"_id":"WmStrBoostTier05","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/strength.png","name":"Worldbearer's Girdle","sort":50000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"str"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0.1},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>The buckle of this legendary girdle depicts a figure supporting the curve of the world.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +5:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Strength modifier by 5. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":17},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"wornbelt"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"str","value":5}}}}
{"_id":"WmDexBoostTier01","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/dexterity.png","name":"Silverwind Signet","sort":110000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"dex"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>A silver feather curls around this light signet, always pointing into the faintest breeze.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +1:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Dexterity modifier by 1. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":1},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"wornring"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"dex","value":1}}}}
{"_id":"WmDexBoostTier02","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/dexterity.png","name":"Quickstep Ring","sort":120000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"dex"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>The pale stone in this ring flashes a heartbeat before its wearer begins to move.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +2:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Dexterity modifier by 2. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":5},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"wornring"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"dex","value":2}}}}
{"_id":"WmDexBoostTier03","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/dexterity.png","name":"Galeweave Signet","sort":130000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"dex"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Fine strands of silver seem to shift like woven wind along this narrow band.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +3:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Dexterity modifier by 3. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":9},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"wornring"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"dex","value":3}}}}
{"_id":"WmDexBoostTier04","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/dexterity.png","name":"Stormdancer Ring","sort":140000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"dex"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Tiny arcs of blue light race around this ring whenever its wearer changes direction.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +4:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Dexterity modifier by 4. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":13},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"wornring"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"dex","value":4}}}}
{"_id":"WmDexBoostTier05","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/dexterity.png","name":"Horizon's Edge Signet","sort":150000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"dex"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>This flawless signet leaves a brief line of dawn-colored light behind every precise gesture.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +5:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Dexterity modifier by 5. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":17},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"wornring"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"dex","value":5}}}}
{"_id":"WmConBoostTier01","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/constitution.png","name":"Hearthstone Amulet","sort":210000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"con"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>The green stone in this bronze amulet remains pleasantly warm even in bitter cold.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +1:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Constitution modifier by 1. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":1},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"wornamulet"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"con","value":1}}}}
{"_id":"WmConBoostTier02","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/constitution.png","name":"Oakheart Pendant","sort":220000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"con"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Living oak filigree slowly knots itself around the gem at the center of this pendant.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +2:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Constitution modifier by 2. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":5},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"wornamulet"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"con","value":2}}}}
{"_id":"WmConBoostTier03","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/constitution.png","name":"Lifeforge Amulet","sort":230000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"con"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>A steady emerald glow beats within this amulet in time with its wearer's pulse.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +3:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Constitution modifier by 3. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":9},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"wornamulet"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"con","value":3}}}}
{"_id":"WmConBoostTier04","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/constitution.png","name":"Adamant Heart Torc","sort":240000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"con"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>This heavy torc feels unyielding, yet settles comfortably against the wearer like a second skin.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +4:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Constitution modifier by 4. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":13},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"wornamulet"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"con","value":4}}}}
{"_id":"WmConBoostTier05","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/constitution.png","name":"Worldroot Amulet","sort":250000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"con"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Ancient root-shaped gold surrounds a gem that seems to contain an endless green forest.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +5:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Constitution modifier by 5. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":17},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"wornamulet"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"con","value":5}}}}
{"_id":"WmIntBoostTier01","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/intelligence.png","name":"Scholar's Circlet","sort":310000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"int"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>This understated silver circlet sharpens small details at the edge of the wearer's attention.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +1:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Intelligence modifier by 1. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":1},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"worncirclet"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"int","value":1}}}}
{"_id":"WmIntBoostTier02","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/intelligence.png","name":"Runebound Mindband","sort":320000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"int"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Violet runes rearrange themselves across this mindband whenever a new problem is considered.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +2:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Intelligence modifier by 2. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":5},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"worncirclet"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"int","value":2}}}}
{"_id":"WmIntBoostTier03","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/intelligence.png","name":"Mnemonic Circlet","sort":330000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"int"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>The central sapphire of this circlet stores memories as fleeting patterns of blue light.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +3:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Intelligence modifier by 3. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":9},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"worncirclet"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"int","value":3}}}}
{"_id":"WmIntBoostTier04","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/intelligence.png","name":"Crown of Living Thought","sort":340000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"int"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Delicate geometric branches unfold from this crown as the wearer's ideas connect.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +4:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Intelligence modifier by 4. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":13},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"worncirclet"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"int","value":4}}}}
{"_id":"WmIntBoostTier05","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/intelligence.png","name":"Diadem of the Infinite Archive","sort":350000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"int"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>An impossible library appears in the depths of this diadem's violet gemstone.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +5:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Intelligence modifier by 5. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":17},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"worncirclet"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"int","value":5}}}}
{"_id":"WmWisBoostTier01","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/wisdom.png","name":"Wayfinder's Sash","sort":410000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"wis"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>The embroidered sun on this traveler's sash brightens subtly near a sound path forward.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +1:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Wisdom modifier by 1. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":1},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"worngarment"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"wis","value":1}}}}
{"_id":"WmWisBoostTier02","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/wisdom.png","name":"Owlthread Sash","sort":420000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"wis"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Owl-feather patterns seem to turn toward movements the wearer has not yet noticed.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +2:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Wisdom modifier by 2. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":5},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"worngarment"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"wis","value":2}}}}
{"_id":"WmWisBoostTier03","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/wisdom.png","name":"Sage's Woven Sash","sort":430000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"wis"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Quiet golden threads shift into symbols that reward patience and careful observation.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +3:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Wisdom modifier by 3. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":9},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"worngarment"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"wis","value":3}}}}
{"_id":"WmWisBoostTier04","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/wisdom.png","name":"Oracle's Moon Sash","sort":440000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"wis"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Moon and cloud motifs drift across this silk sash as possible outcomes are weighed.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +4:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Wisdom modifier by 4. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":13},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"worngarment"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"wis","value":4}}}}
{"_id":"WmWisBoostTier05","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/wisdom.png","name":"Dawnseer's Sash","sort":450000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"wis"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>At daybreak, the embroidered horizon on this sash shines with calm, revealing light.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +5:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Wisdom modifier by 5. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":17},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"worngarment"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"wis","value":5}}}}
{"_id":"WmChaBoostTier01","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/charisma.png","name":"Envoy's Brooch","sort":510000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"cha"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>This polished red-gold brooch catches the eye without overwhelming the wearer's presence.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +1:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Charisma modifier by 1. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":1},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"worn"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"cha","value":1}}}}
{"_id":"WmChaBoostTier02","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/charisma.png","name":"Silver-Tongue Brooch","sort":520000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"cha"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Warm light gathers in this brooch whenever its wearer finds exactly the right words.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +2:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Charisma modifier by 2. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":5},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"worn"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"cha","value":2}}}}
{"_id":"WmChaBoostTier03","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/charisma.png","name":"Herald's Star","sort":530000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"cha"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>The points of this heraldic star brighten as nearby listeners turn their attention to the wearer.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +3:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Charisma modifier by 3. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":9},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"worn"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"cha","value":3}}}}
{"_id":"WmChaBoostTier04","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/charisma.png","name":"Sovereign's Clasp","sort":540000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"cha"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Regal filigree frames a rose-cut gem whose glow carries quiet authority.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +4:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Charisma modifier by 4. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":13},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"worn"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"cha","value":4}}}}
{"_id":"WmChaBoostTier05","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/apex-items/charisma.png","name":"Brooch of Crownless Majesty","sort":550000,"system":{"apex":{"attribute":"cha"},"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>This radiant brooch grants the bearing of a monarch without displaying crown or crest.</p>\n<p><strong>Wrathmaker Item Boost +5:</strong> While this Apex item is invested, selected, and worn, increase your Charisma modifier by 5. Wrathmaker applies this value in place of PF2e's standard Apex adjustment for this item.</p>\n<p>Only one Apex item can be selected at a time.</p>"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":17},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","traits":{"otherTags":["item-boost"],"rarity":"rare","value":["apex","invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"worn"}},"type":"equipment","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"abilityBoost":{"schemaVersion":1,"attribute":"cha","value":5}}}}
